NOTE: the probe ran on port 4600, NOT the default. On a non-default
      port the REAL UI is unusable (the exported page resolves the API
      base to the default port; the Bridge CSP allows only the default
      port -- docs/16-BASELINE-ADR.md §3.1 item 2), so a passing run here
      describes the API seam only, NOT a working UI.
